  "description": "A high-performance, zero-allocation .NET library for Julian Date (JD), Modified Julian Date (MJD), Ordinal Date (YYYYDDD), Vietnamese Lunar Calendar, and Solar Term (Tiết Khí) conversions. AOT-compatible and optimized for low-latency applications.",
